    "text": "If \\(A\\) and \\(\\mathrm{B}\\) are mutually exclusive events and if \\(\\mathrm{P}(\\mathrm{B})=\\frac{1}{3}, \\mathrm{P}(\\mathrm{A} \\cup \\mathrm{B})=\\frac{13}{21}\\), then \\(\\mathrm{P}(\\mathrm{A})\\) is equal to",
